{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217140","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1621714001:1":{"text":"わ、分かったよ！もういい、認める！無理やり買わせようとしたのが悪かった！","source_cn":"好吧——好吧，我认错，我不该强买强卖！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0271E328CF089C2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621714002:1":{"text":"それに、偽物を売りつけようとしたこともだろ！","source_cn":"还有你倒卖假货的事呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x507167E6C99F0548","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621714003:0":{"text":"と、とんでもない！俺だって、この鏡が偽物だなんて知らなかったんだ！","source_cn":"这事我冤枉啊，我真不知道这镜子是仿古的赝品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AD45D568D5C117F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621714004:0":{"text":"俺はただの素人でよ、本物同然の大金を払って仕入れたんだ！それをそのまま転売してただけなのに……ああ、考えただけで腹が立つ……俺だって立派な被害者だよ！","source_cn":"我只是一个外行，这是我从别的地方买来的，还是按照真品的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86611A520AE4D169","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1621714004":{"text":"俺はただの素人でよ、本物同然の大金を払って仕入れたんだ！それをそのまま転売してただけなのに……ああ、考えただけで腹が立つ……俺だって立派な被害者だよ！","source_cn":"我只是一个外行，这是我从别的地方买来的，还是按照真品的价格买来的……哎呦，亏了好多钱呢！这么一说，我也算是受害者……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86611A520AE4D169","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621714005:0":{"text":"わ、分かった……！悪かった、本当に悪かった！","source_cn":"我、我不说，不说了！哎哟，这回算是栽了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF4B6E69417DD8CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621714007:0":{"text":"えっと……まあまあ、お客さんたち落ち着いて……ケンカしてもいいことはないだろ？ほら、これで手打ちだ。この鏡、ただでやるよ。","source_cn":"大家消消气，消消气……和气生财嘛。您看，作为补偿，我把...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62674EC586BF512D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621714008:0":{"text":"ふーん……まあいいわ。私も持ち帰って研究したいと思ってたし。","source_cn":"唔……那好吧。正好我也想拿回去研究一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF28C3B51A1CFF97C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1621714009:0":{"text":"じゃあ、この話は片付いたということで、次は内輪の用件といこうか……","source_cn":"那您这边的事解决了，我也处理一下我的事哈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93A8BF2ADAC07D79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1621714010:0":{"text":"ジロード、お前、クビだ。","source_cn":"吉罗德，我正式通知你，你被解雇了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2D4A350719A6868","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_tit